{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#card-zh","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-auth 是 DSH Web 界面的登录认证插件，接管 webServer 服务并在业务路由前校验会话。它替换默认 Web 服务，提供登录页面、登录与退出接口、状态查询，并为 HTTP 路由和 WebSocket 升级请求应用会话验证。登录后使用 Cookie 维持会话，支持密码或 scrypt 散列、可配置鉴权模式和登录尝试限制。适合需要为 DSH 网页界面增加统一登录入口的使用者。运行需要 Node.js 22 及以上、DSH web profile，并在鉴权启用时配置用户名和密码或密码散列。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-18","src/index.js:314-390","src/index.js:393-439","src/index.js:16-28"]}
{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#card-en","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-web-auth adds login sessions to DSH Web, replacing its webServer service. It provides login and logout pages and checks HTTP and WebSocket requests. It suits users who want a shared login for a DSH web profile. Requires Node.js 22+ and a password or scrypt hash.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:4-18","src/index.js:314-390","src/index.js:393-439","src/index.js:16-28"]}
