{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#feature-1","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-auth 的功能「登录与退出」：提供登录页面，验证用户名和密码后创建会话 Cookie，并提供退出接口清除会话。用户通过 /auth/login 登录，通过 POST /auth/logout 退出。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:331-376"]}
{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#feature-2","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-auth 的功能「HTTP 请求门控」：请求进入业务路由前检查会话；未登录的网页导航跳转至登录页，其他 HTTP 请求返回认证状态 JSON。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:393-422"]}
{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#feature-3","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-auth 的功能「WebSocket 升级会话校验」：处理升级请求时检查当前会话，未认证的连接收到认证错误响应并关闭，已认证连接交给对应路径处理器。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:424-439"]}
{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#feature-4","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-auth 的功能「密码散列生成」：命令行提供 generate 和 hash-password 操作，生成随机口令与 scrypt 散列，或从环境变量、stdin 读取口令并输出散列。","source":"generated","evidence":["bin/dsh-web-auth.js:13-29","src/auth.js:19-34"]}
{"unit_id":"SummerSec__dsh-web-auth#caveat-1","repo":"SummerSec/dsh-web-auth","commit":"b722e44a881d71fc3eb943627d654a6e293876f8","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-auth 使用内存保存会话，进程重启后已有登录会话失效；会话 TTL 可配置，默认 720 分钟。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:179-181","src/auth.js:89-113","cordis.patch.yml:19"]}
